DTSTART:20260917T160000Z
DESCRIPTION:Lighthouse Book Club \nThe Lighthouse Book Club is launching—a 
	new monthly gathering for readers who love stories\, conversation\, and sh
	ared perspective. \nJoin us on the second to last Thursday of each month f
	rom 4:00–5:00 PM in the Boardroom of Building 1\, for an engaging discussi
	on led by Fernando Espinoza\, who will host the club. \nAt each meeting\, 
	Book Club members will collectively choose the next month’s book\, ensurin
	g a rotating\, member-driven reading list. To join the GroupMe chat\, plea
	se click here. \nIf you are in need of help to set up audio books on your 
	phone\, assistance is available. You may email Fernando Espinoza at fespin
	oza@houstonlighthouse.org for more information \nSIGN UP HERE\n\nhttps://h
	oustonlighthouse.org/event/lighthouse_book_club/2026-09-17/\n\nFrom Housto
	n Lighthouse
